  "title": "RMA — Data Security Under §63A-19-102",
  "content": "ElizaChat and Dentacor expressly incorporate Utah Code §63A-19-102. Doctronic applies its policies as if the participant were a governmental entity. Legion instead sets data-security obligations by reference to its Proposal and Office requirements, with reasonable safeguards and general cybersecurity practices under §6.F. Use the agreement governing the participant to identify the applicable baseline.",
